  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed in both technical and everyday contexts. Can describe physical blocking (a gate, wall) or abstract blocking (information, contact).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {電源|でんげん}を{遮断|しゃだん}する (to cut off power)\n- {遮断機|しゃだんき} (crossing gate; circuit breaker)\n- {遮断|しゃだん}{器|き} (circuit breaker)\n- {音|おと}を{遮断|しゃだん}する (to block out sound)\n- {情報|じょうほう}を{遮断|しゃだん}する (to block information)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {遮|さえぎ}る: to block, to intercept (verb; broader usage)\n- {断絶|だんぜつ}: severance, breaking off (more permanent, often for relationships)",
